er husband Carey Hart for nearly $9 million in 2013. What began as an interest in wine grew into Two Wolves, an organic wine business. After years of studying winemaking and making small batches privately, Pink released her first vintage in 2014 and has since built a team around organic farming and winemaking.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2013-pink-paid-nearly-9-million-for-a-200-acre-california-ranch-with-a-10000-sq-ft-home-13-years-later-the-estate-has-become-a-working-organic-vineyard-producing-her-two-wolves-wine/articleshow/134386358.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2013-pink-paid-nearly-9-million-for-a-200-acre-california-ranch-with-a-10000-sq-ft-home-13-years-later-the-estate-has-become-a-working-organic-vineyard-producing-her-two-wolves-wine/articleshow/134386358.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-21T18:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134387627,imgsize-171522.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2018, Jon Bon Jovi paid $10 million for a Palm Beach home, demolished it and rebuilt]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134387191.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2018-jon-bon-jovi-paid-10-million-for-a-palm-beach-home-demolished-it-and-rebuilt-two-years-later-he-sold-the-new-mansion-for-19-85-million-and-bought-a-43-million-estate/articleshow/134387191.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2018-jon-bon-jovi-paid-10-million-for-a-palm-beach-home-demolished-it-and-rebuilt-two-years-later-he-sold-the-new-mansion-for-19-85-million-and-bought-a-43-million-estate/articleshow/134387191.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-21T1