TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134388458,imgsize-774558.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[At 78, Nashville songwriter Jerry Vandiver rescues foxes with mange; 60+ treated this year]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134386534.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a heartwarming display of compassion, Nashville songwriter Jerry Vandiver has devoted himself to rescuing sick red foxes. He skillfully traps these ailing creatures, transporting them to Walden’s Puddle Wildlife Center for much-needed care. In August alone, his dedication earned him 234 volunteer hours, ultimately assisting numerous animals. Through his efforts, he ensures that these foxes can heal and safely return to their natural environments.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-78-nashville-songwriter-jerry-vandiver-spends-hundreds-of-volunteer-hours-trapping-foxes-sick-with-mange-the-wildlife-rescue-he-supports-has-already-treated-more-than-60-foxes-this-year/articleshow/134386534.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-78-nashville-songwriter-jerry-vandiver-spends-hundreds-of-volunteer-hours-trapping-foxes-sick-with-mange-the-wildlife-rescue-he-supports-has-already-treated-more-than-60-foxes-this-year/articleshow/134386534.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-21T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134386791,imgsize-218942.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California acquired 640 acres near Pioneertown for Joshua tree conservation; tribal plans ahead]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134387661.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[California has acquired 640 acres of western Joshua tree habitat northwest of Pioneertown in San Bernardino County, securing land that researchers identify as highly likely to remain suitable for the species in the future. The newly acquired property sits northwest of Pioneertown, in a desert region where western Joshua trees form an important part of the landscape. The acquisition covers 640 acres and was completed by CDFW on August 24 using money from the Western Joshua Tree Conservation Fund.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/california-acquired-640-acres-near-pioneertown-for-western-joshua-tree-conservation-climate-projections-rank-it-among-southern-californias-best-future-habitats-with-tribal-co-management-now-being-planned/articleshow/134387661.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/california-acquired-640-acres-near-pioneertown-for-western-joshua-tree-conservation-climate-projections-rank-it-among-southern-californias-best-future-habitats-with-tribal-co-management-now-being-planned/articleshow/134387661.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-21T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134387736,imgsize-154695.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US on alert after China's 'dual-use' research vessels spotted near Alaska]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134387694.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-on-alert-after-chinas-dual-use-research-vessels-spotted-near-alaska-multiple-times-this-year/articleshow/134387694.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-on-alert-after-chinas-dual-use-research-vessels-spotted-near-alaska-multipl